{"id":"5100","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5100_main_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这个卷云是由一架飞机凝结尾造成的。凝结尾（人为转化性卷云）正在转化为人为转化性絮状卷云，其特征是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云簇</span>伴有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">幡状云</span>；这个过程大约需要半个小时。最终，这导致了凝结物通过落下的冰晶完全消散。飞机高度的风很轻。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国英格兰西伯克郡雷丁Stratfield Mortimer","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 26'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 45'' W","date":"21 June 2014 1931 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.16"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5100_syn_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>不列颠群岛位于一个松弛的山坳中，地表和高空中的风都很轻。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5100_upper_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>高层风非常轻 - 在这个凝结尾的估计高度（可能是7000米）仅有15 kt</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5561_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-3_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的一系列照片的最后一张。云在头顶飘过时拍摄的这张照片比第1张晚31分钟，比第2张晚20分钟。</p>\n<p>图为在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>上的卷云丝条，并在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>以云簇（钩云种）结束。这些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云簇</span>是原生凝迹的余迹。随时间的推移，原生飞机凝结尾迹（人为性卷云）导致了人为转化钩卷云的发展。人为转化一词用于表示此类云的人造、或人为的起源。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1958 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5562_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-1_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的三张系列照片的第一张。</p>\n<p>图片中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>为一些飞机凝结尾迹（人为性卷云）。然而，其主要特征是在照片中沿对角线延伸的更大面积的卷云。这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云</span>，是由于凝迹在西北高空风中扩散而形成。在卷云的下方和左侧可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">原生凝迹</span>，沿对角线向照片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右下角</span>延伸。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云的丝条</span>从原生凝迹向照片右上方发散。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1927 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5563_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-2_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的三张照片中的第二张。它比第一张照片的拍摄时间晚11分钟。</p>\n<p>照片底部，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>的原生飞机凝结尾迹正在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>破碎为云簇。通过这些云簇，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云</span> 的丝条布满了照片。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1938 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"}]}]}